Lunduke's Linux Kernel (lunduke-linux-kernel)
=============================================

Metapackage for linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (ABI lcos7). Recommends matching
headers.

On LCOS 0.7 ISOs this is the default kernel. On older LCOS releases that
still ship a Distro/Devuan kernel, install from the apt overlay, reboot,
and pick 7.2.6-lunduke in GRUB (or set it once).

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install lunduke-linux-kernel

Apt overlay: https://lcos.lunduke.com/apt
